":"2處獨立位置，2個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-jinshu-063-guomo-ws2025242"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-jin063-kongwei-daughter","subject_person_id":"smo_93j_k3f","object_person_id":"m83_vub_zec","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"孔煒女"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-063","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo","source_id":"s-jinshu-063-guomo-ws2025242","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p005","quote":"初，默之被征距蘇峻也，下次尋陽，見胤，胤參佐張滿等輕默，倮露視之，默常切齒。至是，胤臘日餉默酒一器，肫一頭，默對信投之水中，忿憤益甚。又僑人蓋肫先略取祖煥所殺孔煒女為妻，煒家求之，張滿等使還其家，肫不與，因與胤、滿有隙。至是，肫謂默曰：「劉江州不受免，密有異圖，與長史司馬張滿、荀楷等日夜計謀，反逆已形，惟忌郭侯一人，云當先除郭侯而後起事。禍將至矣，宜深備之。」默既懷恨，便率其徒候旦門開襲胤。胤將吏欲距默，默呴之曰：「我被詔有所討，動者誅及三族。」遂入至內寢。胤尚與妾臥，默牽下斬之。出取胤僚佐張滿、荀楷等，誣以大逆。傳胤首于京師，詐作詔書，宜視內外。掠胤女及諸妾，並金寶還船。初云下都，俄而還，停胤故府，招桓宣、王愆期。愆期懼逼，勸默為平南、江州，默從之。愆期因逃廬山，桓宣固守不應。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p005:m0081","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p005:m0079"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"女未具名，原稱孔煒女。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p005:m0079","surface":"孔煒","start":79,"end":81,"person_id":"m83_vub_zec","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p005","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p005:m0085","surface":"煒","start":85,"end":86,"person_id":"m83_vub_zec",